OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treating threatening email
OL,4,Asent to more than 300 schools as 'hoax'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating threatening emails
OL,7,Fsent to schools across Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fare treating the matter as "a hoax".
OL,10,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,11,F(PSNI) said more than "300 schools to
OL,12,Fdate have reported to police receiving
OL,13,Fthe same emailed message".
OL,15,FThe Department of Education had advised
OL,16,Fschools to remain open "unless
OL,17,Fotherwise advised by the PSNI".
