OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treating threatening email
OL,4,Asent to more than 300 schools as 'hoax'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn October, a number of schools closed
OL,7,Fafter an email threatened that "an
OL,8,Fexplosive device" was located within
OL,9,Fhundreds of schools in Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
